(* Regression test: polymorphic function returning a non-bool type used as
   an if-condition should be rejected. The call f(1) instantiates f with
   i64 -> i64, so the if-condition gets a concrete i64, not bool.
*)
(* CHECK: Type error: If condition must be bool{{.*}}
*)
f(x) = x + 1
if f(1) then 2 else 3
